### Get all projects
GET 127.0.0.1:5000/api/demo/projects

### Get scenarios by project ID
GET 127.0.0.1:5000/api/demo/scenarios/merwedekanaalzone

### Get scenarios by project ID where ID doesn't exist
GET 127.0.0.1:5000/api/demo/scenarios/merwedekanaalzon

### Inspect for demo
POST 127.0.0.1:5000/api/inspect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "demo",
  "project_id": "merwedekanaalzone",
  "scenario_id": "groen-gezond-2040"
}
